# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Never commit .env.local.

# Sends "Private Consultation Request" submissions to hello@zentrafinancial.com
# via Gmail SMTP, using an account you already control — not a new vendor.
#
# GMAIL_USER: the Gmail / Google Workspace address to send FROM (e.g.
#   jorge@prontobg.com, or a Zentra Financial address once one exists).
# GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD: a 16-character Gmail "App Password" for that account,
#   not your regular login password. Generate one at
#   https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords (requires 2-Step Verification
#   to be turned on for the account first).
GMAIL_USER=
GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=
